  "body": "Perfectly positioned in the heart of sought-after Bucklands Beach, this beautifully presented three-bedroom home on Sea Spray Drive offers the ideal combination of contemporary style, practical design and effortless family living. Set on a freehold section, this low-maintenance residence presents an excellent opportunity for families, professionals and investors alike.\r\n\r\nStep inside and discover a thoughtfully designed home filled with natural light and modern comforts. The spacious open-plan living and dining area flows seamlessly into a stylish, well-appointed kitchen, creating a welcoming space for everyday family life and entertaining. Quality finishes and warm timber-look flooring add a touch of elegance, making the home both inviting and practical.\r\n\r\nOffering three generous bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, a dedicated study and an additional living area upstairs, this home provides excellent flexibility for growing families, working from home or simply enjoying extra space to relax. A single garage adds everyday convenience, while the easy-care outdoor area allows you to spend more time enjoying life and less time on maintenance.\r\n\r\nLocation is another outstanding highlight. Zoned for the highly desirable Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Pigeon Mountain School, this property offers excellent educational opportunities, with local schools within walking distance. Beautiful beaches, parks, cafes, shopping facilities and other local amenities are all conveniently nearby, making this an exceptional place to call home.\r\n\r\nCombining modern design, freehold ownership and a premium location in the Macleans College zone, this is an opportunity you won't want to miss.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a private viewing or visit our open home and discover everything this fantastic property has to offer!\r\n\r\nhttps://www.teamvishrealestate.co.nz/",
